## ✅ **5. Simple Calculator using switch**

```javascript
let a = 10;
let b = 5;
let op = "+"; // change to -, *, /

switch(op) {
    case "+":
        console.log(a + b);
        break;
    case "-":
        console.log(a - b);
        break;
    case "*":
        console.log(a * b);
        break;
    case "/":
        console.log(a / b);
        break;
    default:
        console.log("Invalid Operator");
}
```

📤 **Output (if op = "+"):**

```
15
```

